              <ul class="post-list">
                <li>Second-story additions for expanding vertical space</li>
                <li>Sunrooms and conservatories for natural light and relaxation</li>
                <li>In-law suites for multi-generational living</li>
                <li>Garage conversions for additional living or storage space</li>
              </ul>

              <h3>3. Kitchen Remodeling</h3>
              <p>A kitchen is the heart of any home, and our kitchen remodeling services help homeowners achieve modern, functional, and beautiful cooking spaces. Our team specializes in:</p>
              <ul class="post-list">
                <li>Custom kitchen cabinetry for a tailored look and efficient storage</li>
